# Blackout: U2 reads CE_N stuck at 1: the ROM never answers, so the CPU never reads the program: it
# runs whatever the open bus and the RAM's random power-on contents give it, and on seed 1 never
# writes the LEDs. Another seed (Debug) may write $8000-$9FFF once and freeze a random pattern there.
# ROM_N itself is right.
machine led_computer
title "Blackout"
brief "The LEDs never light."
fault stuck U2.CE_N 1
